WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
Liu San Liu San

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:02,760
General, you are back

3
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,040
I also said I wanted to meet you for dinner.

4
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:06,000
You have eaten and there is no general

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
These are the things you brought back with meat.

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,320
There is so much rice and vegetables

7
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:11,480
It would be nice to have these things, right?

8
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,920
Get these food to the warehouse

9
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,360
And call Mr. Fan over

10
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:15,800
General, what is this?

11
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,560
This is an iron horse. What is an iron horse?

12
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,160
Can he also run? Of course he can

13
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,480
Damage the things first and call Mr. Fan over. Come over too.

14
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,600
Okay I'll be right over

15
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,060
Where is the boiling water?

16
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,540
General, what is this?

17
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:29,740
Tear open the ingredient packet inside

18
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:30,700
then put it in

19
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,180
Finally, just pour boiling water in

20
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:34,100
That's how it turned out

21
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,820
This is the dry food for lying down in winter

22
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:37,540
They say you can eat it just by soaking it in water

23
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:39,060
If we had enough dry food like this

24
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:40,900
From now on, we only need to bring dry food with us when we go out.
